move.\n00:01.625 - The stroke leaves the top-right of the frame, carrying the eye out of the cut.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nA soft airy room tone with a faint bright shimmer as the stroke passes.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nLight, buoyant electronic pop holding its final phrase, no vocal.\n","width":1664,"height":928,"length":39,"ref_image_size":"match"}},{"id":990,"type":"CreateVideo","pos":[3360,869],"size":[280,142],"flags":{},"order":37,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"images","name":"images","type":"IMAGE","link":32},{"localized_name":"audio","name":"audio","shape":7,"type":"AUDIO","link":33},{"localized_name":"fps","name":"fps","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"fps"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"bit_depth","name":"bit_depth","shape":7,"type":"INT","widget":{"name":"bit_depth"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"VIDEO","name":"VIDEO","type":"VIDEO","slot_index":0,"links":[34]}],"title":"CreateVideo","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.33.0","Node name for S&R":"CreateVideo"},"widgets_values":[24,8],"widgets_values_named":{"fps":24,"bit_depth":8}},{"id":991,"type":"SaveVideo","pos":[3360,1057],"size":[280,106],"flags":{},"order":38,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"video","name":"video","type":"VIDEO","link":34},{"localized_name":"filename_prefix","name":"filename_prefix","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"filename_prefix"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"format","name":"format","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"format"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"codec","name":"codec","type":"COMFY_DYNAMICCOMBO_V3","widget":{"name":"codec"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"video","name":"video","type":"VIDEO","slot_index":0,"links":[]}],"title":"SaveVideo","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.33.0","Node name for S&R":"SaveVideo"},"widgets_values":["video/r2vcut","auto","auto"],"widgets_values_named":{"filename_prefix":"video/r2vcut","format":"auto","codec":"auto"}},{"id":90000,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[0,64],"size":[470,240],"flags":{},"order":6,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"1. モデル","properties":{},"widgets_values":["## 1. モデル\n\n`UNETLoader` → `MiniMaxH3SigmaShift` → `PathchSageAttentionKJ` の順。\n\n**SigmaShift は 12 / 3 のまま**。H3 の学習時の値です。\n\n蒸留 LoRA（PDD / turbo）は入れていません。部分書き換えでは\n素のモデルの方が文字と細部が正確でした。8 step でも 39 フレームなら\n**約 150 秒**で終わります。"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"## 1. モデル\n\n`UNETLoader` → `MiniMaxH3SigmaShift` → `PathchSageAttentionKJ` の順。\n\n**SigmaShift は 12 / 3 のまま**。H3 の学習時の値です。\n\n蒸留 LoRA（PDD / turbo）は入れていません。部分書き換えでは\n素のモデルの方が文字と細部が正確でした。8 step でも 39 フレームなら\n**約 150 秒**で終わります。"},"color":"#3f5159","bgcolor":"#3f5159"},{"id":90001,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[560,64],"size":[470,300],"flags":{},"order":7,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"2. 参照","properties":{},"widgets_values":["## 2. 参照\n\n**`LoadImage`** — 差し替えたい人物・物の新しいキービジュアル。\n外見はここからしか来ません。プロンプトの文章では上書きできません。\n\n**`MiniMaxH3ReferenceVideoPrepare`** — 元カットの動画。構図と動きの見本です。\n\n`length` は書き換える尺と一致させ、**`length % 17 == 5`** を満たすこと\n（5, 22, 39, 56, 73, 90, 107 ...）。\n\n**参照動画には音声トラックが必須**です。無音だと\n`H3 reference-video prep requires source audio` で止まります。\nまた元動画は length より数フレーム長く用意してください。"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"## 2. 参照\n\n**`LoadImage`** — 差し替えたい人物・物の新しいキービジュアル。\n外見はここからしか来ません。プロンプトの文章では上書きできません。\n\n**`MiniMaxH3ReferenceVideoPrepare`** — 元カットの動画。構図と動きの見本です。\n\n`length` は書き換える尺と一致させ、**`length % 17 == 5`** を満たすこと\n（5, 22, 39, 56, 73, 90, 107 ...）。\n\n**参照動画には音声トラックが必須**です。無音だと\n`H3 reference-video prep requires source audio` で止まります。\nまた元動画は length より数フレーム長く用意してください。"},"color":"#4a5f3f","bgcolor":"#4a5f3f"},{"id":90002,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[1120,64],"size":[470,270],"flags":{},"order":8,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"3. 条件付け","properties":{},"widgets_values":["## 3. 条件付け\n\n`MiniMaxH3ReferenceToVideo` が参照画像・参照動画・プロンプトを\nひとつの条件にまとめます。Contex Loop のスケジュール参照は使いません。\n\nプロンプトの要点は 2 つです。\n\n- 参照画像を **fully_preserved as APPEARANCE**（髪と服はここから取る）\n- 参照動画を **fully_preserved as MOTION AND STAGING ONLY, never as appearance**\n\nこの区別を書かないと、参照動画の中の元の姿に引き戻されます。"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"## 3. 条件付け\n\n`MiniMaxH3ReferenceToVideo` が参照画像・参照動画・プロンプトを\nひとつの条件にまとめます。Contex Loop のスケジュール参照は使いません。\n\nプロンプトの要点は 2 つです。\n\n- 参照画像を **fully_preserved as APPEARANCE**（髪と服はここから取る）\n- 参照動画を **fully_preserved as MOTION AND STAGING ONLY, never as appearance**\n\nこの区別を書かないと、参照動画の中の元の姿に引き戻されます。"},"color":"#5a4a63","bgcolor":"#5a4a63"},{"id":90004,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[2240,64],"size":[470,255],"flags":{},"order":9,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"5. マスク","properties":{},"widgets_values":["## 5. マスク\n\n矩形と時間範囲を指定し、その内側だけを振り直します。外側は\n元の潜在がそのまま残るので、文字・ロゴ・背景は 1 画素も動きません。\n\n- **strength 0.9** — 内容を変えるならこの辺り。0.5 は色ムラ抑制程度、\n  0.8 では色が淡く出ることがあります\n- **時間分解能は実フレーム 4 枚**（潜在 1 枚 = 実 4 枚）。端 3 枚は\n  道連れになるので、窓を前後に広く取り、結合時に捨てます\n- ノイズを止めてはいけません。`DisableNoise` と併用すると破綻します"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"## 5. マスク\n\n矩形と時間範囲を指定し、その内側だけを振り直します。外側は\n元の潜在がそのまま残るので、文字・ロゴ・背景は 1 画素も動きません。\n\n- **strength 0.9** — 内容を変えるならこの辺り。0.5 は色ムラ抑制程度、\n  0.8 では色が淡く出ることがあります\n- **時間分解能は実フレーム 4 枚**（潜在 1 枚 = 実 4 枚）。端 3 枚は\n  道連れになるので、窓を前後に広く取り、結合時に捨てます\n- ノイズを止めてはいけません。`DisableNoise` と併用すると破綻します"},"color":"#6b3f47","bgcolor":"#6b3f47"},{"id":90005,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[2800,64],"size":[470,210],"flags":{},"order":10,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"6. サンプリング","properties":{},"widgets_values":["## 6. サンプリング\n\n`BasicScheduler` は `denoise 1.0` のまま。マスクが範囲を決めるので、\nここを下げる必要はありません（下げてもステップ数は減りません）。\n\nシードを振っても、マスクと参照で強く拘束されるため\n結果はほぼ同じに収束します。"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"## 6. サンプリング\n\n`BasicScheduler` は `denoise 1.0` のまま。マスクが範囲を決めるので、\nここを下げる必要はありません（下げてもステップ数は減りません）。\n\nシードを振っても、マスクと参照で強く拘束されるため\n結果はほぼ同じに収束します。"},"color":"#3f4f63","bgcolor":"#3f4f63"},{"id":90006,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[3360,64],"size":[470,195],"flags":{},"order":11,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"7. 出力","properties":{},"widgets_values":["## 7. 出力\n\n映像と音声を別々にデコードして 1 本にまとめます。\n\n出力は指定した窓の全フレームです。**端の数フレームは捨てて**、\n元の動画に差し戻してください。"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"## 7. 出力\n\n映像と音声を別々にデコードして 1 本にまとめます。\n\n出力は指定した窓の全フレームです。**端の数フレームは捨てて**、\n元の動画に差し戻してください。"},"color":"#4a4a4a","bgcolor":"#4a4a4a"},{"id":225,"type":"MiniMaxH3DenoiseMask","pos":[2240,365],"size":[280,274],"flags":{},"order":29,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"samples","name":"samples","type":"LATENT","link":31},{"localized_name":"track","name":"track","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"track"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"strength","name":"strength","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"strength"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"t_start_pct","name":"t_start_pct","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"t_start_pct"},"link":42},{"localized_name":"t_end_pct","name":"t_end_pct","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"t_end_pct"},"link":43},{"localized_name":"t_feather_pct","name":"t_feather_pct","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"t_feather_pct"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"x_pct","name":"x_pct","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"x_pct"},"link":37},{"localized_name":"y_pct","name":"y_pct","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"y_pct"},"link":38},{"localized_name":"w_pct","name":"w_pct","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"w_pct"},"link":39},{"localized_name":"h_pct","name":"h_pct","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"h_pct"},"link":40},{"localized_name":"feather_pct","name":"feather_pct","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"feather_pct"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"samples","name":"samples","type":"LATENT","slot_index":0,"links":[5]}],"title":"MiniMaxH3DenoiseMask","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"MiniMaxH3DenoiseMask"},"widgets_values":["video only",0.9,2.6,97.4,0,46,14,54,86,2],"widgets_values_named":{"track":"video only","strength":0.9,"t_start_pct":2.6,"t_end_pct":97.4,"t_feather_pct":0,"x_pct":46,"y_pct":14,"w_pct":54,"h_pct":86,"feather_pct":2}},{"id":202,"type":"LoadImage","pos":[565.4219336721263,614.2910826425845],"size":[280,314],"flags":{},"order":12,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"image","name":"image","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"image"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"choose file to upload","name":"upload","type":"IMAGEUPLOAD","widget":{"name":"upload"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"IMAGE","name":"IMAGE","type":"IMAGE","slot_index":0,"links":[21]},{"localized_name":"MASK","name":"MASK","type":"MASK","slot_index":1,"links":[]}],"title":"LoadImage","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.33.0","Node name for S&R":"LoadImage"},"widgets_values":["pc_kv_taipa_new.png","image"],"widgets_values_named":{"image":"pc_kv_taipa_new.png","upload":"image"}},{"id":224,"type":"MiniMaxH3PackLatent","pos":[1686.9856627186368,1556.8828952854785],"size":[280,142],"flags":{},"order":27,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"video_latent","name":"video_latent","type":"LATENT","link":29},{"localized_name":"audio_latent","name":"audio_latent","type":"LATENT","link":30}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"samples","name":"samples","type":"LATENT","slot_index":0,"links":[31,41]}],"title":"MiniMaxH3PackLatent","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"MiniMaxH3PackLatent"}},{"id":223,"type":"VAEEncodeAudio","pos":[1686.9856627186368,1368.8828952854785],"size":[280,142],"flags":{},"order":26,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"audio","name":"audio","type":"AUDIO","link":27},{"localized_name":"vae","name":"vae","type":"VAE","link":28}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"LATENT","name":"LATENT","type":"LATENT","slot_index":0,"links":[30]}],"title":"VAEEncodeAudio","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.33.0","Node name for S&R":"VAEEncodeAudio"}},{"id":222,"type":"VAEEncode","pos":[1686.9856627186368,1180.8828952854783],"size":[280,142],"flags":{},"order":25,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"pixels","name":"pixels","type":"IMAGE","link":25},{"localized_name":"vae","name":"vae","type":"VAE","link":26}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"LATENT","name":"LATENT","type":"LATENT","slot_index":0,"links":[29]}],"title":"VAEEncode","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.33.0","Node name for S&R":"VAEEncode"}},{"id":221,"type":"GetVideoComponents","pos":[1691.6427711977287,1014.2257868063882],"size":[280,116],"flags":{},"order":21,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"video","name":"video","type":"VIDEO","link":24}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"images","name":"images","type":"IMAGE","slot_index":0,"links":[25]},{"localized_name":"audio","name":"audio","type":"AUDIO","slot_index":1,"links":[27]},{"localized_name":"fps","name":"fps","type":"FLOAT","slot_index":2,"links":[]},{"localized_name":"bit_depth","name":"bit_depth","type":"INT","slot_index":3,"links":[]}],"title":"GetVideoComponents","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.33.0","Node name for S&R":"GetVideoComponents"}},{"id":90008,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[2780.35822339573,1285.8569247589],"size":[380,250],"flags":{},"order":15,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"矩形の選び方","properties":{},"widgets_values":["## 矩形の選び方\n\n1. 一度実行するとノードにフレームが出ます\n2. その上を**ドラッグして矩形を描く**と、右下のハンドルでサイズ調整できます\n3. 4つの値がマスクに直接つながっているので、手で入れ直す必要はありません\n\n`frame` を変えれば別のフレームを見られます。**割合なので、どのフレームで描いても同じ矩形**です。\n\n矩形の中に文字やロゴが入ると、そこも書き換え対象になります。**入れないように囲むか、\n参照画像で何があるかを教えること。**"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"## 矩形の選び方\n\n1. 一度実行するとノードにフレームが出ます\n2. その上を**ドラッグして矩形を描く**と、右下のハンドルでサイズ調整できます\n3. 4つの値がマスクに直接つながっているので、手で入れ直す必要はありません\n\n`frame` を変えれば別のフレームを見られます。**割合なので、どのフレームで描いても同じ矩形**です。\n\n矩形の中に文字やロゴが入ると、そこも書き換え対象になります。**入れないように囲むか、\n参照画像で何があるかを教えること。**"},"color":"#6b3f47","bgcolor":"#6b3f47"},{"id":90010,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[2782.8208751885286,1593.4458530474315],"size":[400,300],"flags":{},"order":16,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"時間範囲はフレームで","properties":{},"widgets_values":["## 時間範囲はフレームで\n\n`end_frame` は Python のスライスと同じで**その番号を含みません**。\n\n`samples` をつないであるので、実行前に `report` に\n**丸めた後の実際の範囲**が出ます。\n\n```\nframes 1-38 of 39  ->  2.56% - 97.44%\nlatent T=12, 3.25 rendered frames per latent frame\nactually covers frames 0.0-39.0  <- wider than asked\n```\n\n**マスクは潜在の時間軸に乗ります。**107 フレームなら潜在は 32 枚しか\nなく、1 枚が実 3.34 フレーム分。両端は必ず外側へ広がります。\n\n対策は、書き換えたいカットより**前後に広く窓を取り、余ったフレームは\n結合時に捨てる**こと。カットの境界ぴったりに合わせようとしても、\nグリッドがそれを許しません。"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"## 時間範囲はフレームで\n\n`end_frame` は Python のスライスと同じで**その番号を含みません**。\n\n`samples` をつないであるので、実行前に `report` に\n**丸めた後の実際の範囲**が出ます。\n\n```\nframes 1-38 of 39  ->  2.56% - 97.44%\nlatent T=12, 3.25 rendered frames per latent frame\nactually covers frames 0.0-39.0  <- wider than asked\n```\n\n**マスクは潜在の時間軸に乗ります。**107 フレームなら潜在は 32 枚しか\nなく、1 枚が実 3.34 フレーム分。両端は必ず外側へ広がります。\n\n対策は、書き換えたいカットより**前後に広く窓を取り、余ったフレームは\n結合時に捨てる**こと。カットの境界ぴったりに合わせようとしても、\nグリッドがそれを許しません。"},"color":"#6b3f47","bgcolor":"#6b3f47"},{"id":90007,"type":"MiniMaxH3RegionPicker","pos":[2250.0551205798556,770.1509058461926],"size":[390.12094285463536,482.76938878473334],"flags":{},"order":22,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"images","name":"images","shape":7,"type":"IMAGE","link":null},{"localized_name":"video","name":"video","shape":7,"type":"VIDEO","link":36},{"localized_name":"frame","name":"frame","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"frame"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"x_pct","name":"x_pct","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"x_pct"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"y_pct","name":"y_pct","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"y_pct"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"w_pct","name":"w_pct","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"w_pct"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"h_pct","name":"h_pct","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"h_pct"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"x_pct","name":"x_pct","type":"FLOAT","slot_index":0,"links":[37]},{"localized_name":"y_pct","name":"y_pct","type":"FLOAT","slot_index":1,"links":[38]},{"localized_name":"w_pct","name":"w_pct","type":"FLOAT","slot_index":2,"links":[39]},{"localized_name":"h_pct","name":"h_pct","type":"FLOAT","slot_index":3,"links":[40]},{"localized_name":"preview","name":"preview","type":"IMAGE","slot_index":4,"links":[]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"MiniMaxH3RegionPicker"},"widgets_values":[20,44.5,36,41.5,64],"widgets_values_named":{"frame":20,"x_pct":44.5,"y_pct":36,"w_pct":41.5,"h_pct":64}},{"id":90003,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[1680,64],"size":[468.5541510207663,168.6105234907887],"flags":{},"order":17,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"4. 元動画から潜在","properties":{},"widgets_values":["## 4. 元動画から潜在\n\n書き換えたいカットの mp4 を VAE で潜在に戻します。\nチェックポイントが残っていなくても使えるのがこの経路の利点です。\n\n映像と音声を別々にエンコードし、`MiniMaxH3PackLatent` で\nH3 の NestedTensor（[映像, 音声]）に組み立てます。\n\n**長さは必ず `length % 17 == 5`。** 85 フレームのような無効な長さを\n入れると、往復で 73 フレームに減って戻ってきます。"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"## 4. 元動画から潜在\n\n書き換えたいカットの mp4 を VAE で潜在に戻します。\nチェックポイントが残っていなくても使えるのがこの経路の利点です。\n\n映像と音声を別々にエンコードし、`MiniMaxH3PackLatent` で\nH3 の NestedTensor（[映像, 音声]）に組み立てます。\n\n**長さは必ず `length % 17 == 5`。** 85 フレームのような無効な長さを\n入れると、往復で 73 フレームに減って戻ってきます。"},"color":"#63563f","bgcolor":"#63563f"},{"id":90011,"type":"ResolutionSelector","pos":[1098.8452242175829,841.3788898976401],"size":[360,126],"flags":{},"order":18,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"aspect_ratio","name":"aspect_ratio","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"aspect_ratio"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"megapixels","name":"megapixels","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"megapixels"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"multiple","name":"multiple","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"multiple"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"width","name":"width","type":"INT","slot_index":0,"links":[45]},{"localized_name":"height","name":"height","type":"INT","slot_index":1,"links":[46]}],"title":"Resolution (megapixels)","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.33.0","Node name for S&R":"ResolutionSelector"},"widgets_values":["16:9 (Widescreen)",1.5,32],"widgets_values_named":{"aspect_ratio":"16:9 (Widescreen)","megapixels":1.5,"multiple":32}},{"id":90012,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[1104.9900823793262,1010.174926627678],"size":[360,230],"flags":{},"order":19,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"解像度","properties":{},"widgets_values":["## 解像度\n\n`megapixels` で指定します。**1.5 MP、16:9、multiple 32** が\nこのプロジェクトの全実行で使った設定です（1664 x 928）。\n\n**解像度を変えるとサンプルそのものが変わります。**同じシードでも\n同じ絵にはなりません。安く試してから本番、という使い方はできません。\n\n**書き換え対象の潜在と解像度を合わせてください。**元のクリップが\n1.5 MP なら 1.5 MP のまま。違う値にすると、マスクの外まで\n作り直しになります。\n\nJapanese text は 1 MP を下回ると崩れます。"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"## 解像度\n\n`megapixels` で指定します。**1.5 MP、16:9、multiple 32** が\nこのプロジェクトの全実行で使った設定です（1664 x 928）。\n\n**解像度を変えるとサンプルそのものが変わります。**同じシードでも\n同じ絵にはなりません。安く試してから本番、という使い方はできません。\n\n**書き換え対象の潜在と解像度を合わせてください。**元のクリップが\n1.5 MP なら 1.5 MP のまま。違う値にすると、マスクの外まで\n作り直しになります。\n\nJapanese text は 1 MP を下回ると崩れます。"},"color":"#4a4a63","bgcolor":"#4a4a63"},{"id":90009,"type":"MiniMaxH3TimeRange","pos":[2241.2241592449227,1332.5622088341552],"size":[420,400],"flags":{},"order":28,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"samples","name":"samples","type":"LATENT","link":41},{"localized_name":"video","name":"video","shape":7,"type":"VIDEO","link":44},{"localized_name":"images","name":"images","shape":7,"type":"IMAGE","link":null},{"localized_name":"start_frame","name":"start_frame","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"start_frame"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"end_frame","name":"end_frame","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"end_frame"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"t_start_pct","name":"t_start_pct","type":"FLOAT","slot_index":0,"links":[42]},{"localized_name":"t_end_pct","name":"t_end_pct","type":"FLOAT","slot_index":1,"links":[43]},{"localized_name":"length","name":"length","type":"INT","slot_index":2,"links":[50,51]},{"localized_name":"report","name":"report","type":"STRING","slot_index":3,"links":[]},{"localized_name":"preview","name":"preview","type":"IMAGE","slot_index":4,"links":[]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"MiniMaxH3TimeRange"},"widgets_values":[1,39],"widgets_values_named":{"start_frame":1,"end_frame":39}},{"id":200,"type":"LoadVideo","pos":[1665.902972452473,272.8271275738538],"size":[280,236.10526315789477],"flags":{},"order":13,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_n